21
00:00:48,717 --> 00:00:50,687
(Penny:)Mm-hmm.

22
00:00:50,686 --> 00:00:52,716
(Mrs Cooper:)At least the bearded man
that I believe in

23
00:00:52,721 --> 00:00:54,991
(Mrs Cooper:)preaches love and compassion.

24
00:00:54,990 --> 00:00:56,390
(Mrs Cooper:)All yours
talks about is

25
00:00:56,391 --> 00:00:57,821
(Mrs Cooper:)why you hold in your poop

26
00:00:57,826 --> 00:01:02,026
(Mrs Cooper:)and want to crawl back
inside your mama.

